  "title": { "zh": "转运环：四机抢位", "en": "Freight Carousel" },
  "concept": { "zh": "一对四 · 三批转运电池", "en": "One versus four · Three battery shipments" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "和四台机器人争抢 14 块电池。8 块分布在场内，6 块锁在转运仓。第 4、8、12 回合结束后，转运仓各送出两块电池，几条通道同时切换。有机器人或电池占着的门当次保持打开。对手会看比分和路线换目标。多人同回合拾取同一块电池时，优先权按芽芽、灯塔号、铆钉号、接力号、罗盘号的顺序逐回合轮换，第 1 回合从芽芽开始。电池全部被拾取或打满 20 回合时，电池最多且独占第一才算赢。从容模式用同一程序赢下三张地图。",
    "en": "Compete against four robots for 14 batteries. Eight start on the floor and six are locked in the freight bay. Two batteries are released after turns 4, 8, and 12, and passages switch at the same time. An occupied gate stays open for that shift. Rivals change targets as scores and routes change. When robots try to pick up the same battery in one turn, priority rotates from Sprout to Lantern, Rivet, Relay, and Compass, starting with Sprout on turn 1. Finish first outright when all batteries are collected or after 20 turns. In Relaxed mode, one program must win on all three maps."
  },
